<title>FINLAND: MUNICIPAL HOUSING 2002 BOND RAISES FIM 180.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>MUNICIPAL HOUSING 2002 BOND RAISES FIM 180.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Svenska Handelsbanken Markets</p>
<p>Helsinki announced the following issue of Municipal Housing</p>
<p>Finance Ltd's 2002 bond:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Municipal Housing Finance</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     27-11-2002</p>
<p> COUPON:				 5.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			5.54 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  98.623</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT:		     FIM 180.5 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 790.5 MLN</p>
<p> OUTSTANDING AMOUNT:		 FIM 180.5 MLN</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
